{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/pulls/6","id":4821022253,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVB4h8c8AAAABH1r2LQ","html_url":"https://github.com/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/pull/6","diff_url":"https://github.com/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/pull/6.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/pull/6.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/F1u0rite/meituan_challenge_ws/issues/6","number":6,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(calibration): V1 TF/TCP 离线交付与 fake 模型核验","user":{"login":"yyslyd","id":104951612,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkFvPA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104951612?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd","html_url":"https://github.com/yyslyd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyslyd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"当前 Calibration / TF / TCP 分工缺少可复现的完整位姿转换检查和明确的参数交接。此 PR 交付 AUBO S3 + 法兰附近 D435i + V1 舌规的离线校验、测量清单与现场流程，并对齐已合入 main 的 MoveIt 规划模块；仅变更本分工的脚本、测试、配置清单和文档。\n\n@F1u0rite：这一部分的软件/文档已完成并复核，请审查后决定合入 main。分支已同步 main `f7eaa2c`，负责人可从根目录 `TF_AND_CALIBRATION_HANDOFF.md` 开始查看，进度汇报在 `docs/calibration/TONIGHT_STATUS.md`。\n\n## 结果与交接\n\n- 保留完整 6D 位姿、xyzw 四元数、frame 与观测时间；校验变换链、TCP 逆偏置，拒绝未知外参、缺 TF、非法单位/姿态/时间。诊断输出始终 `motion_authorized=false`。\n- 保留 Claude 优化：修正 17.5 mm 的螺孔中心线基准和安装假设说明，按 D435i / D435if 区分深度零平面，补齐 schema、int64 与 JSON/CLI 异常处理。设计外参仍 ESTIMATED，不写入真实站点参数。\n- 复核常提供的 URDF、SRDF、三份 TF 日志及 PDF，与 main 归档一致；新增独立 4×4 FK 核验和回归测试。fake planning frame 为 world、EE 为 ee_link，wrist3→ee 有 +90° yaw；fake 读数不等于真实标定。\n- 明确规划器已负责 TCP 逆补偿，需交付 T_ee_link_TCP，避免重复补偿；工位目前是落座 TCP 位置，规划尚未消费独立工位朝向。详见 `docs/calibration/FAKE_RUNTIME_AUDIT.md`。\n\n## 验证\n\n`python -B scripts/calibration/run_offline_validation.py`：54/54 测试通过，无跳过；6 个文档/材料用例、5 个生成反例、JSON/CSV/42 个本地链接检查全部通过。证据与精确命令保存在 `docs/calibration/validation/results.json`，可离线重建。\n\n独立只读复核另重跑 54 项与一键验证器；Claude 优化额外 11 个 CLI 异常输入探针均拒绝。未发现需合入前修复的问题。本机未重新启动 ROS 或运行机械臂。\n\n## 现场待完成与协作\n\n此 PR 可作为离线交付合入；真实执行仍需采集/验证相机安装外参、V1 TCP、台面/T0、ring 轴向、误差及年龄阈值。真实清单仍 UNKNOWN/null，未实现手眼求解器或 ROS 监听/自动拒绝接入。\n\n请视觉/集成/规划确认采集 ROS stamp 与历史 TF 的接入：当前 main backend 查询 latest TF，不能据此认为随腕运动的 D435i 已完成同步；FSM 时基不能直接当 ROS 时间。本 PR 已记录接入要求，未修改其他成员的规划/FSM/IDL/驱动代码。V1 预对准看门狗问题仍按现有规划报告由相关负责人决定，本 PR 未更改限速或看门狗。\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T17:41:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T00:49:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T00:49:00Z","merged_at":"2026-10-12T00:49:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"9fea32eee901a3a0e5c3d2ad3a0f3c12aa51093b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"F1u0rite","id":46274026,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Mjc0MDI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46274026?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite","html_url":"https://github.com/F1u0rite","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F1u0rite/received_events","type":"User","user_view_t